+; Parc: FairPlay Streaming playback in the media service (AVContentKeySession,
+; AVSampleBufferDisplayLayer, AVSampleBufferAudioRenderer). Each rule was
+; checked by playing FairPlay in this profile with AVFoundation loaded inside
